  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts Nancy Pelosi with overlaid text that falsely attributes hateful and racist rhetoric to Democratic politicians, including Ilhan Omar, Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez, and Ayanna Pressley. The text claims they 'hate whites, jews, christians, conservatives, republicans,' which is a direct and false attack on these individuals and their political affiliation, invoking harmful stereotypes and targeting protected characteristics. This is a hateful meme designed to delegitimize and demonize specific political figures and their ideology through false and inflammatory claims, using the visual of Pelosi to imply she is the source or representative of this alleged hatred. The meme's intent is to incite division, spread misinformation, and promote prejudice against Democrats and their supporters.",
